  "m_questLevel": 105,
  "m_questRepeat": 0,
  "m_onStartQuestScript": "",
  "m_onEndQuestScript": "",
  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You must understand - Mirage is a world of constant change, ever-shifting Sands. But the last few years have seen a rash of massive sand storms.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_02.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "More recently, there was a sand storm of colossal proportions. During the storm, somehow, the World Door in Mirage was lost in the Sands.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_03.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You see, the Sands of Mirage are unique. They're more than elements in a desert landscape. They are - quite literally - the Sands of Time.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Thus the World Door is lost, not just in space, but in time as well. I believe, however, I've devised a way to reach it and to restore it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I have not yet pinpointed its exact location in the space-time continuum, but this portal can at least get you in the vicinity.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Take the portal, find the lost World Door where it is buried, and use this charm to restore it to its proper time and place. Then return.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Good luck, Initiate. After you've used the charm to restore the World Door, return through the portal and we will discuss next steps.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/QismahShasa_MIR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340971,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
